<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Meet the Team</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Meet the Team</h1>
    <p>Get to know the people behind our website!</p>
  </header>

  <main class="team-section">

    <div class="team-member">
      <img src="images/person1.jpg" alt="Person 1">

      <h2>Alex Johnson</h2>
      <h3>Team Leader</h3>

      <p>
        Alex helps organize the team and makes sure everything
        stays on track.
      </p>
    </div>


    <div class="team-member">
      <img src="images/person2.jpg" alt="Person 2">

      <h2>Jamie Smith</h2>
      <h3>Web Designer</h3>

      <p>
        Jamie designs the website and works on making it
        easy and enjoyable to use.
      </p>
    </div>


    <div class="team-member">
      <img src="images/person3.jpg" alt="Person 3">

      <h2>Taylor Brown</h2>
      <h3>Content Manager</h3>

      <p>
        Taylor creates and manages the announcements,
        photos, and other website content.
      </p>
    </div>


    <div class="team-member">
      <img src="images/person4.jpg" alt="Person 4">

      <h2>Jordan Lee</h2>
      <h3>Developer</h3>

      <p>
        Jordan works on the code and helps keep the
        website running smoothly.
      </p>
    </div>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
